@startuml
title EcoTrack Platform - Emissions Management Frontend Bounded Context Layers
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle

package "Emissions Management Frontend Bounded Context" {
  class "Presentation" as Frontend_emissions_Presentation <<layer>>
  class "Application" as Frontend_emissions_Application <<layer>>
  class "Domain" as Frontend_emissions_Domain <<layer>>
  class "Infrastructure" as Frontend_emissions_Infrastructure <<layer>>
}

Frontend_emissions_Presentation ..> Frontend_emissions_Application : dispatches actions
Frontend_emissions_Application ..> Frontend_emissions_Domain : reads / updates view models
Frontend_emissions_Application ..> Frontend_emissions_Infrastructure : requests data
Frontend_emissions_Infrastructure ..> Frontend_emissions_Domain : maps responses to

@enduml
